{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05308","headline":"奉和圣制龙池篇 · 卢怀慎","name":"奉和圣制龙池篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"代邸东南龙跃泉，清漪碧浪远浮天。\n楼台影就波中出，日月光疑镜里悬。\n雁沼洄流成舜海，龟书荐社应尧年。\n大川既济慙爲楫，报德空思奉细涓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢怀慎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}